<title>BELGIUM: France, Belgium as one on EMU timing, terms - Chirac.</title>
<headline>France, Belgium as one on EMU timing, terms - Chirac.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac said on Wednesday during a visit to Belgium that both countries were as one one the issue of economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
<p>&quot;We, Belgium and France, are on exactly the same line on EMU. The euro and monetary union must be put into place on the date and in the conditions set out in (the) Maastricht (treaty),&quot; Chirac said.</p>
</text>
